;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>For <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> and me it was the second time, for <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> the third, at Zahha.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As always, there were a lot of high-schoolers.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hear whispering voices.<PG>
"Hey, hey, the one who died today, they say it's <STYLE ID="3">that girl's dad</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Seriously!? He died today and she's at Zahha?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's more, they say that <STYLE ID="1">third-year</STYLE> got questioned as the culprit."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
High-schoolers get their information fast.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> seemed bothered by the eyes around her.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, there's no need to worry about it, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That said, it's certain that, really, I'm in no position to be coming to Zahha like this either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As soon as <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s story was over, I had to contact the relatives and the funeral home.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpaaai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "五島.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
No sooner had she taken her seat than <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> raised her bright voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, is it your treat this time too!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"A-are you an idiot!? I already used up today's budget!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Aww, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you cheapskaaate!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you an idiot!? You </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">hyena</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Whooo are you calling a hyena!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　To this genius </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">pretty</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> girl, as everyone agrees, me included, Erina Goto!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Since when are you a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">pretty</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Now, now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, whenever the three of us get together, it's usually like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This atmosphere feels so nostalgic.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Mwahahahaha! I put a cuuurse on them. So the culprit is meee."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Y-you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! You'd poke at something that touchy!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm a third-year in high school and I've still got eighth-grader syndroooome."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Gyaah! Damn... by now it's completely my embarrassing past..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
It seemed a text message had arrived from someone I didn't know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it spam?<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="6">“This is Ise from Motoki Police Station. Thanks for all your trouble today. There's something I couldn't tell you earlier, so please contact this phone number right away, somewhere </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> isn't around.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
What... does this mean...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I immediately sent a look to <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, never mind that―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> seemed to have caught on right away, and she stopped her blatant teasing of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Aaaaaah!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> stood up and screamed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A tense atmosphere returned between us once again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花座り込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah... ahh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s whole body was trembling.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I knew it...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time, it seemed <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s phone had rung.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hello!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Yes... yes... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll be right there!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, you guys! We'll talk later!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What on earth is going on!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Did you guys forget!?</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">　We ordered same-day pizza delivery at Motoki Station, didn't we!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Sorry! I'll be right back!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"She's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">the most pizza-crazy girl in Japan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"If we can't hear </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s story, there's nothing for it... Shall we leave too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll send </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a message saying we're heading back..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "600" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The sun had already set completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> had left her bicycle with the police, so for the time being I decided to have her come with me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come to think of it, I left my bicycle in front of the station too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If you tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it'll be fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Also, you've got a lot of tough preparations ahead, right?</STYLE>　<STYLE ID="2">I'll help too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"No, no. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I owe you more than I can ever repay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"There you go exaggerating again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"It's no exaggeration. I'm who I am today thanks to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you, Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> says this kind of thing at every opportunity.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Now then, what should I do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then, could you look for the relatives' address book? I think it's probably on one of the shelves."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Understood!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Maybe I'll look up how funerals are done.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hmm... but in cases like this, does the sect matter or something?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does our family even have a sect or anything?<BR>
The Niimura family seems to be of a special sect, though.<PG>
