<STYLE ID="12">To </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Akane,</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">At present, </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> 800, April 6　23:00.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">The reason I go to the trouble of writing this down on paper and not in an email is so that no evidence of any kind leaks out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">On the night of Shiyo 800, April 7, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">that is, tomorrow, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="12">I have decided to meet </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="12">I will negotiate that matter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, I am sorry to ask this of you, but as much as you can, please try to act as usual in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">Needless to say, if this becomes public, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> will probably no longer be able to live in society.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Everything is for the two of them. Above all, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> must never find out anything at all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">And we have no choice but to have </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> go on living believing in the curse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">If we don't, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, too, will probably be erased from society.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> already heard this from me, but be very careful about </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">'s cell phone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">There is no knowing what may be in this house, either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">As much as you can, please live as usual.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">Believe in me and wait. By the morning of April 8, it should all be over.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> is no fool either. She probably won't lay a hand on our family.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">In return, though, </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">'s true identity can't be made common knowledge either.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="12">But if anything should happen, on April 8 you must absolutely not leave </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> alone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> find yourself unable to act, make sure she spends it together with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">, just the two of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">If you have her keep staying at the police station for no reason, the police may get suspicious.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> mustn't find out, so do it carefully.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">I'm counting on you.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Ryoji Kogori</STYLE><PG>
